    			<p class="e-hu2hyx-e00005-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00005">CLAUSE RADAR</p>
					<p class="e-hu2hyx-e00006-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00006">COVERAGE SPECIFICATION · REV 4.2 · JUNE 2026</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00007 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-hu2hyx-e00007-s " data-id="e00007" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00007">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00008 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-hu2hyx-e00008-s " data-id="e00008" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00008">
    			<h1 data-interaction-id="e00009" class="e-hu2hyx-e00009-s e-heading-base">Clause coverage and measured accuracy</h1>
					<p class="e-hu2hyx-e0000a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000a">Clause Radar reviews inbound contracts against your playbook and returns a redline where every change cites the clause it came from. Here is exactly which clause types it covers and how often it is wrong.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-hu2hyx-e0000b-s " data-id="e0000b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000b">
    			<p class="e-hu2hyx-e0000c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000c">MEASURED ON 4,180 INBOUND CONTRACTS</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-hu2hyx-e0000d-s " data-id="e0000d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000d">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-hu2hyx-e0000e-s " data-id="e0000e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000e">
    			<p class="e-hu2hyx-e0000f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000f">11</p>
					<p class="e-hu2hyx-e0000g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000g">clause types</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-hu2hyx-e0000h-s " data-id="e0000h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000h">
    			<p class="e-hu2hyx-e0000i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000i">0.96</p>
					<p class="e-hu2hyx-e0000j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000j">median recall</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0000k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-hu2hyx-e0000k-s " data-id="e0000k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0000k">
    			<p class="e-hu2hyx-e0000l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000l">0.04</p>
					<p class="e-hu2hyx-e0000m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0000m">median false positives</p>
		
</div>

