					<p class="e-hu2hyx-e0009p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0009p">Two hours with your counsel and ours. You leave with your positions encoded as readable rules and a coverage report against your last fifty inbound contracts — before you decide anything.</p>
